                0.482,
                0.586,
                0.58
              ],
              "content": "？ 5 × 4 + 3 ≠ 5 × (4 + 3). Can you explain why?\nAns:\n5 × 4 + 3 = (5 × 4) + 3 = 23.\n5 × (4 + 3) = 5 × 7 = 35\nSo, 5 × 4 + 3 ≠ 5 × (4 + 3)"
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "guess_lang": "txt"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
