            0.634
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Is 5 × (4 + 3) = 5 × (3 + 4) = (3 + 4) × 5? Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Yes, all three expressions are equal."
